<section>
  <exercises>
    <heading level="1">Section 4.8 Exercises</heading>
    <paragraph>For the following exercises, evaluate the limit.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="356" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Evaluate the limit $$\underset{x\rightarrow\infty}{\lim }\frac{e^{x}}{x}.$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="357" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Evaluate the limit $$\underset{x\rightarrow\infty}{\lim }\frac{e^{x}}{x^{k}}.$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$\infty \infty$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="358" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Evaluate the limit $$\underset{x\rightarrow\infty}{\lim }\frac{\ln x}{x^{k}}.$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="359" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Evaluate the limit $$\underset{x\rightarrow a}{\lim }\frac{x - a}{x^{2} - a^{2}}, a \neq 0$$ .</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$1 2 a 1 2 a$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="360" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Evaluate the limit $$\underset{x\rightarrow a}{\lim }\frac{x - a}{x^{3} - a^{3}}, a \neq 0$$ .</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="361" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Evaluate the limit $$\underset{x\rightarrow a}{\lim }\frac{x - a}{x^{n} - a^{n}}, a \neq 0$$ .</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$1 n a n - 1 1 n a n - 1$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <paragraph>For the following exercises, determine whether you can apply L’Hôpital’s rule directly. Explain why or why not. Then, indicate if there is some way you can alter the limit so you can apply L’Hôpital’s rule.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="362" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow 0^{+}}{\lim }x^{2}\ln x$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="363" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow\infty}{\lim }x^{1/x}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>Cannot apply directly; use logarithms</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="364" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow 0}{\lim }x^{2/x}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="365" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow 0}{\lim }\frac{x^{2}}{1/x}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>Cannot apply directly; rewrite as $$limx\to 0x3limx\to 0x3$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="366" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow\infty}{\lim }\frac{e^{x}}{x}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <paragraph>For the following exercises, evaluate the limits with either L’Hôpital’s rule or previously learned methods.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="367" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow 3}{\lim }\frac{x^{2} - 9}{x - 3}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$6 6$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="368" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow 3}{\lim }\frac{x^{2} - 9}{x + 3}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="369" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow 0}{\lim }\frac{\left( {1 + x} \right)^{-2} - 1}{x}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
